OL,3,GNEWSAPilot tracking domestic abuse
OL,4,Asuspects to begin in 2027 - Swinney
OL,5,Atells Holyrood
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Swinney tells MSPs that a pilot to
OL,8,FGPS track suspects and perpetrators of
OL,9,Fdomestic abuse will begin next year
OL,11,FDuring a debate on preventing violence
OL,12,Fagainst women and girls, the first
OL,13,Fminister said the trial would be
OL,14,Foverseen by Sheriff Principal Gillian
OL,15,FWade and operate in the Tayside Central
OL,16,Fand Fife sheriffdom areas
OL,18,FAhead of the debate Swinney answered
OL,19,Fquestions from backbench MSPs
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
